<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 45-5 V NEW ZEALAND AT CLOSE IN FIRST TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 45-5 V NEW ZEALAND AT CLOSE IN FIRST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>LAHORE, Pakistan 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan, chasing a</p>
<p>victory target of 276, were 45 for five at the close on the</p>
<p>third day of the first test against New Zealand on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand 155 and 311.</p>
<p>Pakistan 191 and 45-5.</p>
</text>
